# Airbnb Flip Interaction — an Airbnb-style identity card that flips on Y (underdamped spring, backface hidden) between the "Reactiive / Verified" front and the stats back; the description below swaps pages with keyframe enter/exit animations under an animated BlurView whose intensity peaks mid-flip.
# What this test covers: flip to the back (back page "Profile Overview" asserted) and to the front ("Identity
# Verification"), flipping again while the spring is mid-flight and while it overshoots (blur intensity
# interpolated outside its range by the overshoot), a rapid tap burst racing the page keyframes, tapping the
# description (not a toggle), and scrolling the page.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/airbnb-flip-interaction"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "Identity Verification" 10000
wait 800
# Flip to the back and back to the front, settled.
press 201 222
wait "text" "Profile Overview" 3000
wait 1500
press 201 222
wait "text" "Identity Verification" 3000
wait 1500
# Re-flip mid-flight, then during the overshoot.
press 201 222
wait 200
press 201 222
wait 600
press 201 222
wait 900
press 201 222
wait 2000
wait "text" "Identity Verification" 3000
# Rapid burst (odd count: ends on the back).
press 201 222 --count 5 --interval-ms 120
wait 2500
wait "text" "Profile Overview" 3000
# Tapping the description does nothing.
press 201 480
wait 600
wait "text" "Profile Overview" 3000
# Scroll the page up and back.
swipe 201 700 201 400
wait 800
swipe 201 400 201 700
wait 800
# Back to the front.
press 201 222
wait 2000
wait "text" "Identity Verification" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
